  "description": "I’ve returned to that dreadful early spring. The season when I had my blood drawn under the pretense of a ritual for the Countess, and endured appalling treatment without even knowing my mother was dead. In my past life, it was the cursed Grand Duke, Kalian Orpheus, who saved me from hell. Our contract marriage began with a promise: if he would rescue me from the Count’s mansion, I would purify him from his madness. Though it started purely as a contract, I found myself helplessly falling for him. I was happy. Though my end was tragic, due to the Countess’s curse. To uncover the truth behind my death and my mother’s, I must escape the Count’s mansion once more. As a powerless bastard child, I have no choice but to use you again.\n\n*“Just one more time… may I rely on you?”*\n\nFalling in love with you wasn’t part of the plan. At least not in this life.\n\n(Source: KakaoPage, translated)",
